/*
  MoreDetailsPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0145 · MoreDetailsPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `MoreDetailsPanel` resolves (table "MoreDetailsPanel") lives here with its web English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time;
  they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drive-detail/MoreDetailsPanel.tsx) — the canonical
  `driveDetail.*` namespace. The remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip,
  stale/offline banner, loading + error + retry copy, empty hint, and the elevation gain/loss
  VoiceOver labels).
*/

